WEBVTT

00:01.595 --> 00:02.932
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.956 --> 00:04.291
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.315 --> 00:07.531
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.555 --> 00:13.115
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.115 --> 01:31.075
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.235 --> 01:34.475
=Episode 22=

01:46.815 --> 01:47.815
Where's Xu Fengnian?

01:55.000 --> 01:56.000
Senior,

01:56.350 --> 01:57.725
please keep an eye on them.

01:57.925 --> 01:59.765
Why are you still going out
when badly wounded?

02:00.150 --> 02:01.700
I have to go.

02:17.500 --> 02:18.500
Uncle.

02:23.000 --> 02:24.350
Where are your Buddha beads?

02:24.825 --> 02:25.825
Not wearing it?

02:28.325 --> 02:30.225
Are they all subordinates you have now?

02:34.575 --> 02:36.455
May I have a word with you, Uncle?

02:41.300 --> 02:42.300
Follow up.

02:46.275 --> 02:47.451
Let me go with you, Your Highness.

02:47.475 --> 02:48.475
Stay here.

02:48.975 --> 02:50.535
I'll have a private talk with him.

03:08.050 --> 03:09.695
Wang Mingyin died?

03:10.750 --> 03:12.855
No.11 Swordsman is true to his name.

03:13.215 --> 03:14.231
Luckily, I have Li Chungang

03:14.255 --> 03:16.455
who could do Snakes in Sleeves.

03:19.550 --> 03:20.935
He's still alive?

03:21.600 --> 03:23.475
He's in my carriage.

03:25.125 --> 03:26.775
Then why did you still come with me?

03:28.500 --> 03:29.655
Why didn't I?

03:31.600 --> 03:33.295
If you stayed around Li Chungang,

03:33.750 --> 03:35.975
you might stay alive.

03:37.150 --> 03:38.815
You don't want to kill me.

03:40.025 --> 03:41.215
What should I worry about?

03:42.550 --> 03:43.651
If I don't want to kill you,

03:43.675 --> 03:45.715
why did I invite No.11 Swordsman?

03:46.375 --> 03:48.071
If you wanted to kill me,

03:48.095 --> 03:49.525
you could have used your army.

03:50.325 --> 03:52.300
Why did you bother
to invite a swordsman?

03:55.700 --> 03:57.215
Then why do you think

03:58.125 --> 04:00.150
I asked Wang Mingyin

04:00.895 --> 04:01.950
to kill you?

04:05.650 --> 04:07.625
You arranged the assassination
in the reeds

04:08.725 --> 04:10.950
to put up a show for someone.

04:11.850 --> 04:13.031
Who do you mean?

04:13.055 --> 04:14.055
Someone in the capital.

04:14.175 --> 04:15.175
The royal family.

04:16.650 --> 04:18.135
North Liang is hard to control.

04:18.450 --> 04:20.770
There's also a huge army in Qingzhou.

04:21.550 --> 04:22.775
They're both vassal towns.

04:23.225 --> 04:25.255
If you didn't assassinate me,

04:25.750 --> 04:28.475
you couldn't reassure the royal family.

04:29.975 --> 04:31.735
So, you also know

04:31.875 --> 04:34.615
Qingzhou and North Liang
are bound to be enemies.

04:37.075 --> 04:38.855
It's just the trend of times.

04:40.850 --> 04:43.175
The problem could have been
easily solved.

04:44.300 --> 04:46.055
As long as you gave Wang Linquan to me,

04:46.125 --> 04:47.735
you could have left Qingzhou.

04:48.095 --> 04:49.135
But now,

04:50.575 --> 04:52.615
there's no turning back
for neither you nor me.

04:52.800 --> 04:54.695
It's Xu Xiao's plan.

04:54.875 --> 04:55.935
I don't like it.

04:56.625 --> 04:58.215
So, I'll find a way out by myself.

04:58.475 --> 04:59.826
Do you mean

04:59.850 --> 05:01.215
flirting with my wife?

05:06.125 --> 05:07.375
In Xiangfan

05:08.200 --> 05:09.875
and even the entire Qingzhou,

05:10.725 --> 05:12.151
everybody knows

05:12.175 --> 05:13.655
that you love

05:13.825 --> 05:15.415
your wife Pei Nanwei most.

05:15.550 --> 05:17.135
Everyone in Qingzhou knows

05:17.225 --> 05:18.751
Lord of Jing'an treats
Consort Pei Nanwei

05:18.775 --> 05:19.800
as a treasure.

05:19.925 --> 05:21.151
Zhao Xun, son of Lord of Jing'an,

05:21.175 --> 05:22.600
once was obsessed with Pei Nanwei.

05:22.700 --> 05:23.502
Later,

05:23.526 --> 05:25.501
Lord of Jing'an married her.

05:25.525 --> 05:26.352
After they got married,

05:26.376 --> 05:28.751
His Lordship loved her a lot.

05:28.775 --> 05:30.351
Not only in Xiangfan,

05:30.375 --> 05:31.535
but also throughout Qingzhou,

05:31.950 --> 05:33.495
everyone knows

05:33.775 --> 05:35.800
Lord of Jing'an loves his wife most.

05:37.000 --> 05:38.076
But I...

05:38.100 --> 05:39.815
I've been thinking about something.

05:41.525 --> 05:43.895
What kind of man are you?

05:45.675 --> 05:47.275
When lords were fighting for the throne,

05:47.450 --> 05:49.175
you were the most scheming one.

05:50.300 --> 05:52.391
Your own clique didn't show up

05:52.415 --> 05:53.855
until the last minute.

05:54.625 --> 05:56.335
You were just unlucky

05:56.550 --> 05:58.455
so that you failed.

06:02.200 --> 06:04.191
It was a long time ago.

06:04.215 --> 06:05.615
What's the point of bringing it up?

06:06.875 --> 06:09.055
Why would such a scheming man like you

06:09.800 --> 06:12.050
let everybody in Qingzhou

06:12.250 --> 06:13.855
know your Achilles' heel?

06:15.250 --> 06:17.535
If you really loved Pei Nanwei,

06:18.025 --> 06:19.695
you would only keep her in your mansion

06:19.775 --> 06:21.295
and let no one know about her.

06:25.850 --> 06:27.295
Don't you know who I am?

06:27.375 --> 06:28.175
Back off!

06:28.275 --> 06:29.975
Lord of Jing'an is quite generous.

06:30.650 --> 06:32.775
He'll even let his wife die with us.

06:34.625 --> 06:35.975
A man with an Achilles' heel

06:36.200 --> 06:37.720
will reassure others.

06:39.525 --> 06:40.525
However,

06:41.100 --> 06:43.425
if we only focus on that,

06:44.150 --> 06:46.630
we'll ignore the real danger.

06:48.825 --> 06:51.550
Pei Nanwei is my Achilles' heel?

06:52.000 --> 06:54.655
You make people think
she's your Achilles' heel.

06:55.475 --> 06:56.855
She's the scapegoat only.

06:57.900 --> 07:00.125
We're talking about
whether I'll kill you.

07:00.525 --> 07:01.975
Aren't you getting off the subject?

07:02.900 --> 07:04.735
The Achilles' heel you gave me

07:05.225 --> 07:06.895
is the chance of my survival.

07:09.050 --> 07:10.935
You know it very well.

07:11.050 --> 07:13.511
This is the only good reason

07:13.535 --> 07:15.575
for letting me leave Qingzhou.

07:16.150 --> 07:17.150
Also,

07:17.425 --> 07:19.615
it won't make the court suspect you.

07:22.075 --> 07:23.975
See the nephew off.

07:25.675 --> 07:27.471
When I saw your message,

07:27.495 --> 07:29.055
I explained to Pei Nanwei

07:29.625 --> 07:31.215
that there were two meanings

07:32.200 --> 07:33.631
of the four words.

07:33.655 --> 07:34.655
Two meanings?

07:35.900 --> 07:37.415
The first one is easy to understand.

07:38.975 --> 07:40.401
Off means down,

07:40.425 --> 07:41.825
namely the hell.

07:42.325 --> 07:44.500
He wants to kill me.

07:45.225 --> 07:46.725
The first meaning

07:48.000 --> 07:50.055
is for people in the world.

07:51.150 --> 07:52.791
As I flirted with your wife,

07:52.815 --> 07:54.470
you wanted to kill me.

07:55.875 --> 07:57.625
What about the second meaning?

07:59.125 --> 08:01.095
The second meaning...

08:01.950 --> 08:03.855
You're giving me a present.

08:04.300 --> 08:06.055
The present will accompany me

08:06.325 --> 08:08.295
and see me off.

08:09.050 --> 08:10.450
What's the present?

08:10.525 --> 08:12.925
Pei Nanwei, of course.

08:14.175 --> 08:16.895
I'm giving my wife to you?

08:17.625 --> 08:19.126
This is the best reason

08:19.150 --> 08:20.375
for not killing me.

08:22.150 --> 08:23.911
I'm lecherous and absurd.

08:23.935 --> 08:25.255
And I'm daring.

08:25.575 --> 08:27.135
I not only flirted with your wife,

08:27.300 --> 08:28.780
but also kidnapped her.

08:29.100 --> 08:30.100
In the end,

08:30.125 --> 08:31.375
I'll threaten you

08:31.625 --> 08:32.825
with her life.

08:33.425 --> 08:34.425
You don't have a choice,

08:34.575 --> 08:36.615
but to let me leave Qingzhou.

08:37.775 --> 08:38.975
What's better,

08:39.225 --> 08:40.471
after you let me leave,

08:40.495 --> 08:42.351
the court won't worry

08:42.375 --> 08:44.500
that you may ally with us secretly.

08:45.175 --> 08:46.676
After all, we're not going to make up

08:46.700 --> 08:48.060
because I've taken away your wife.

08:49.300 --> 08:50.725
If I

08:51.700 --> 08:53.495
really wanted to let you go,

08:54.875 --> 08:57.175
why did I arrange

08:58.225 --> 09:00.215
the assassination in the reeds?

09:00.550 --> 09:01.975
If you didn't,

09:02.300 --> 09:03.935
the court wouldn't be relieved.

09:06.300 --> 09:07.575
It's a fake assassination?

09:09.125 --> 09:10.655
It's not.

09:11.350 --> 09:12.975
If I died,

09:13.750 --> 09:14.975
it would only mean

09:15.250 --> 09:17.495
I wasn't qualified to be your ally.

09:17.575 --> 09:18.815
Ally?

09:19.600 --> 09:21.655
Under cover of the feud,

09:22.075 --> 09:23.495
Qingzhou and North Liang

09:24.225 --> 09:25.695
may help each other

09:25.925 --> 09:27.615
in the future.

09:28.875 --> 09:30.295
The premise is

09:31.650 --> 09:33.810
that you become the Lord of North Liang.

09:38.200 --> 09:40.175
Don't you want to try

09:41.650 --> 09:43.575
fighting for the throne again?

09:59.695 --> 10:00.975
Xu Xiao...

10:03.095 --> 10:05.295
has a good son.

10:26.425 --> 10:28.335
I saw what you did.

10:28.900 --> 10:30.735
We both want to kill Xu Fengnian.

10:31.200 --> 10:32.200
We can

10:32.300 --> 10:33.415
join hands.

10:33.625 --> 10:35.750
The gold is all mine.

10:36.150 --> 10:37.150
Get lost.

10:37.300 --> 10:38.300
Otherwise,

10:38.500 --> 10:39.500
I'll kill you.

11:06.800 --> 11:07.800
Go away.

11:08.900 --> 11:09.911
All right then.

11:09.935 --> 11:11.175
I'm going away.

11:35.725 --> 11:36.725
Go.

11:57.600 --> 11:58.925
Where's His Highness?

12:09.775 --> 12:10.951
I got the Book of Blade

12:10.975 --> 12:12.950
from Wudi City.

12:13.525 --> 12:15.015
Now that you use blades,

12:15.200 --> 12:16.480
it will be helpful.

12:17.850 --> 12:19.175
What's in the wooden box?

12:20.300 --> 12:23.255
Half of Mumaniu.

12:23.925 --> 12:25.255
Li Chungang's sword?

12:25.800 --> 12:26.800
Exactly.

12:27.575 --> 12:29.735
It was broken by Wang Xianzhi.

12:30.350 --> 12:32.135
But a broken sword

12:32.375 --> 12:33.751
can still be of great use

12:33.775 --> 12:35.255
in the hands of God of Sword.

12:36.100 --> 12:37.415
You prepared it in advance.

12:38.225 --> 12:40.695
Did you know
Li Chungang would travel with me?

12:42.225 --> 12:43.911
I knew he was around you

12:43.935 --> 12:47.175
so that I asked No.11 swordsman
to assassinate you without concern.

12:49.175 --> 12:50.975
The assassination had to be real.

12:52.350 --> 12:55.190
But I couldn't really kill you.

12:55.900 --> 12:58.431
Otherwise, your crazy father

12:58.455 --> 13:00.375
would certainly start a war against me.

13:03.025 --> 13:06.055
I believe in Buddhism.

13:06.725 --> 13:10.250
But I don't want to die for that.

13:16.900 --> 13:18.055
Off you go.

13:18.825 --> 13:19.935
One last question.

13:20.650 --> 13:22.335
Did you spend a thousand taels of gold

13:22.475 --> 13:23.935
hiring a girl to kill me?

13:24.925 --> 13:26.255
I did.

13:26.525 --> 13:28.311
Miss Hehe is an assassin you've trained?

13:28.335 --> 13:29.615
You've asked too many questions.

13:38.275 --> 13:39.855
The last piece of advice for you.

13:41.025 --> 13:43.215
Don't take Pei Nanwei to Wudi City.

13:43.600 --> 13:45.015
She's fishy.

13:45.250 --> 13:46.351
I suspected

13:46.375 --> 13:48.215
that she approached my son deliberately.

13:48.455 --> 13:49.455
That's why

13:49.900 --> 13:52.095
I married her first!

14:38.175 --> 14:39.255
He left?

14:39.775 --> 14:40.775
Yes.

14:41.500 --> 14:42.800
And he left you to me.

14:46.400 --> 14:47.900
Don't you want to ask

14:48.550 --> 14:50.295
what I'm going to do with you?

14:52.825 --> 14:54.505
I have one question.

14:55.200 --> 14:56.200
Speak.

14:57.300 --> 14:58.895
You had Wang Linquan sent away

14:59.225 --> 15:00.695
and invited me to the reeds,

15:01.125 --> 15:03.055
because you knew
there would be an assassination?

15:04.750 --> 15:06.055
I did know that.

15:07.125 --> 15:08.815
You let the Wang Family live.

15:09.300 --> 15:11.620
But you had Fengzi Battalion
take the risk for you.

15:13.100 --> 15:14.215
These soldiers

15:14.650 --> 15:16.210
died for you.

15:20.550 --> 15:21.655
Xu Fengnian,

15:22.150 --> 15:24.215
you're quite hypocritical.

15:24.600 --> 15:25.600
Shut up!

15:33.750 --> 15:34.895
It's different.

15:35.625 --> 15:36.775
What makes it different?

15:38.600 --> 15:41.120
A hundred soldiers of Fengzi Battalion
left North Liang with me.

15:43.425 --> 15:45.295
We met Fujiang Armor in the rain.

15:46.125 --> 15:47.615
Forty-five of them died.

15:49.655 --> 15:51.055
In the boat fight on Chunshen Lake,

15:51.325 --> 15:52.735
another two soldiers died.

15:55.575 --> 15:56.855
After today's battle,

15:58.815 --> 15:59.935
less than ten soldiers

16:01.800 --> 16:03.095
are still alive.

16:05.700 --> 16:07.176
Those who died in battles

16:07.200 --> 16:08.855
are from North Liang

16:09.925 --> 16:11.700
just like the Wang Family.

16:13.475 --> 16:15.095
But they have different identities.

16:17.275 --> 16:18.575
The Wang Family

16:18.975 --> 16:20.215
are ordinary people.

16:20.875 --> 16:22.375
Those in Fengzi Battalion

16:23.150 --> 16:24.415
are soldiers!

16:25.500 --> 16:27.015
A soldier's duty

16:27.250 --> 16:29.311
is to protect ordinary people

16:29.335 --> 16:31.735
like the Wang Family

16:32.700 --> 16:34.055
with his blood and weapon!

16:36.575 --> 16:38.175
I've kept in mind

16:38.625 --> 16:40.150
those who died.

16:42.000 --> 16:43.415
I feel sad.

16:46.000 --> 16:47.511
But if I were given a second chance,

16:47.535 --> 16:49.075
I would make the same choice!

16:49.475 --> 16:51.250
Because I couldn't escape.

16:52.350 --> 16:53.815
I wouldn't escape, either.

16:56.000 --> 16:57.055
From first to last,

16:57.950 --> 16:59.950
I've been fighting with them

17:00.650 --> 17:02.015
shoulder by shoulder

17:02.850 --> 17:04.335
and confronting the moment of death!

17:06.275 --> 17:08.255
Your Highness, it's our honor

17:09.575 --> 17:11.175
to fight shoulder by shoulder with you.

17:22.275 --> 17:23.275
Your Highness.

17:46.100 --> 17:47.375
Qingniao hasn't woken up yet?

17:47.575 --> 17:49.900
She's in the other carriage.
Someone's taking care of her.

17:51.300 --> 17:52.791
Luckily, I completed the conversation.

17:52.815 --> 17:55.475
If Lord of Jing'an realized
I was badly wounded,

17:56.025 --> 17:58.255
he might not let me leave safely.

17:59.325 --> 18:01.051
You've made a good deal.

18:01.075 --> 18:02.301
You planned

18:02.325 --> 18:03.845
to kidnap Consort of Jing'an long ago.

18:04.200 --> 18:05.975
If Lord of Jing'an
didn't give me a chance,

18:06.200 --> 18:07.711
he wouldn't ask Pei Nanwei

18:07.735 --> 18:09.071
to bring a message to the weeds.

18:09.095 --> 18:10.855
We just understood each other.

18:11.100 --> 18:13.431
You and that old fox
understood each other?

18:13.455 --> 18:14.800
You're birds of a feather.

18:14.875 --> 18:15.991
He's an old fox.

18:16.015 --> 18:17.451
But I'm a young phoenix.

18:17.475 --> 18:18.871
You're both beasts, anyway.

18:18.895 --> 18:20.855
You're getting more sharp-tongued.

18:21.300 --> 18:22.735
Speaking of beasts,

18:22.975 --> 18:24.471
I think of something.

18:24.495 --> 18:25.495
What is it?

18:25.700 --> 18:27.271
Do you remember I saw a dead Hukui

18:27.295 --> 18:28.631
on Mount Qingcheng?

18:28.655 --> 18:31.175
I got lost in the woods

18:31.300 --> 18:33.735
and saw someone rush past,
riding on a giant beast.

18:34.625 --> 18:36.335
I wonder what killed Hukui.

18:36.500 --> 18:37.591
I saw that.

18:37.615 --> 18:39.051
It rushed past me.

18:39.075 --> 18:40.150
What did it look like?

18:40.750 --> 18:43.150
It was so fast
that I didn't see it clearly.

18:43.525 --> 18:45.675
It was black and white,

18:45.800 --> 18:48.135
carrying a girl on its back.

18:48.900 --> 18:51.301
When I think of it now,

18:51.325 --> 18:54.005
the girl was like that assassin
when looked from behind.

18:54.100 --> 18:56.725
Are you saying Miss Hehe killed Hukui?

18:57.875 --> 19:00.235
Then she followed us
as early as we were on Mount Qingcheng?

19:01.525 --> 19:02.591
It doesn't make sense.

19:02.615 --> 19:04.335
We didn't arrive in Qingzhou
at that time.

19:05.175 --> 19:06.431
Does she want to kill me

19:06.455 --> 19:08.215
not simply for the gold
from Lord of Jing'an?

19:08.500 --> 19:09.895
She lied to you.

19:10.775 --> 19:12.591
Did she want to kill me

19:12.615 --> 19:14.335
even when she sold braised beef
in Lingzhou?

19:15.100 --> 19:16.111
It doesn't make sense, either.

19:16.135 --> 19:17.112
She could have assassinated me
many times these years.

19:17.136 --> 19:18.575
Why bother waiting until now?

19:18.950 --> 19:19.577
Come on.

19:19.601 --> 19:20.951
What's your relationship

19:20.975 --> 19:22.476
with Miss Hehe?

19:22.500 --> 19:24.620
I met her several times
when I did some beef shopping.

19:25.050 --> 19:26.231
I didn't even know her name.

19:26.255 --> 19:27.631
Because she kept smiling,

19:27.655 --> 19:28.935
I named her Miss Hehe.

19:29.275 --> 19:30.072
Also,

19:30.096 --> 19:31.311
Lord Jing'an reminded me.

19:31.335 --> 19:32.951
Pei Nanwei can't go with us.

19:32.975 --> 19:34.500
Care about yourself, first.

19:34.600 --> 19:35.775
Why?

19:35.800 --> 19:37.600
Your eyes are bleeding.

19:49.125 --> 19:51.005
Bleeding from all the seven openings
of my head?

19:52.275 --> 19:53.695
I've heard about it.

19:54.125 --> 19:55.191
Unexpectedly,

19:55.215 --> 19:56.495
I could experience it by myself.

19:56.525 --> 19:58.725
If you keep experiencing it, you'll die.

20:01.350 --> 20:02.375
Senior,

20:03.650 --> 20:05.575
you mentioned the way
to destroy my pubic region.

20:06.350 --> 20:07.615
But is there an alternative?

20:08.450 --> 20:09.450
Yes.

20:11.275 --> 20:12.575
Please instruct me.

20:13.025 --> 20:14.231
Digest the genuine spirit

20:14.255 --> 20:15.735
and you can live with a new body.

20:16.000 --> 20:16.976
A new body?

20:17.000 --> 20:18.000
Mm.

20:18.200 --> 20:19.911
Hidden in your body,

20:19.935 --> 20:21.951
Dahuangting goes into your passages
as time goes by.

20:21.975 --> 20:24.095
It's a stable process,
but it dissipates quickly, too.

20:24.335 --> 20:25.871
If it goes on like this,

20:25.895 --> 20:28.051
you'll digest 30% at most.

20:28.075 --> 20:29.876
But that girl badly wounded you

20:29.900 --> 20:31.101
and you've got a disorder in your body.

20:31.125 --> 20:33.015
If you can take the chance

20:33.075 --> 20:34.191
to digest Dahuangting forcibly,

20:34.215 --> 20:35.631
you can absorb 50% at least

20:35.655 --> 20:38.351
after you make it.

20:38.375 --> 20:39.475
In this way,

20:39.725 --> 20:41.300
you're kind of getting a new body.

20:41.800 --> 20:43.401
You mean I can survive

20:43.425 --> 20:44.231
and even get more power?

20:44.255 --> 20:44.912
No, no, no.

20:44.936 --> 20:46.026
When you digest it forcibly,

20:46.050 --> 20:47.911
you'll be rising from the dead.

20:47.935 --> 20:50.076
The breakthrough in passages
will be like thousands of cuts.

20:50.100 --> 20:52.400
How long can you bear the pain?

20:53.425 --> 20:54.625
How long do I have to bear it?

20:54.925 --> 20:56.791
I'm not sure.

20:56.815 --> 20:57.831
In every moment of the process,

20:57.855 --> 20:59.275
you'll feel like you're skinned.

21:00.325 --> 21:02.175
Once you start it, you can't stop.

21:02.425 --> 21:03.855
If you give up,

21:04.025 --> 21:05.675
your passages will break
and you're dead.

21:05.925 --> 21:06.951
It's unbearable

21:06.975 --> 21:08.425
for humans.

21:08.750 --> 21:09.592
I want to give it a try.

21:09.616 --> 21:11.111
You're the son of Lord of North Liang.

21:11.135 --> 21:12.311
You're already influential.

21:12.335 --> 21:13.601
Even if you can't do martial arts,

21:13.625 --> 21:15.300
you don't need to take the risk!

21:15.500 --> 21:17.026
Old Huang died
when he challenged Wang Xianzhi.

21:17.050 --> 21:17.952
One day,

21:17.976 --> 21:19.275
I'll fight Wang Xianzhi for him.

21:19.850 --> 21:21.475
Only for Jian Jiuhuang?

21:25.525 --> 21:26.855
I don't know

21:27.500 --> 21:28.735
who killed my mother.

21:29.850 --> 21:30.850
In the future,

21:31.275 --> 21:32.695
I'll avenge her by myself.

21:34.950 --> 21:36.015
You've made up your mind?

21:36.450 --> 21:37.450
Yes.

21:39.100 --> 21:40.591
You made the choice yourself.

21:40.615 --> 21:41.655
Don't blame me if you die.

21:41.900 --> 21:42.872
I won't blame you.

21:42.896 --> 21:43.911
I ask for that.

21:43.935 --> 21:45.055
Don't you try to stop him?

21:47.000 --> 21:48.720
If I were him,
I would make the same choice.

21:49.975 --> 21:51.025
All right, then.

21:51.250 --> 21:52.351
Take off your clothes.

21:52.375 --> 21:54.025
Sit comfortably.

21:56.125 --> 21:57.950
Man, stay still.

21:58.400 --> 22:00.951
I'm going to transmit the genuine spirit
into your passages.

22:00.975 --> 22:03.250
You have to bear it alone after that.

22:04.400 --> 22:05.575
Thank you, senior.

22:07.350 --> 22:08.350
Come on.

22:37.255 --> 22:38.751
This is just the beginning.

22:38.775 --> 22:40.000
Bear it.

22:57.650 --> 22:58.750
Stop the carriage!

23:15.200 --> 23:16.215
Senior.

23:16.775 --> 23:18.175
You can't help him.

23:18.450 --> 23:19.735
He has to bear

23:19.975 --> 23:21.215
the cutting pain.

23:35.950 --> 23:37.415
It's better than death, anyway.

23:40.695 --> 23:42.255
If you die, you can do nothing.

24:03.025 --> 24:04.305
Why isn't there a sound anymore?

24:05.225 --> 24:06.441
He's been suffering
for such a long time.

24:06.465 --> 24:07.676
I guess he's too exhausted to yell

24:07.700 --> 24:09.075
or move.

24:09.900 --> 24:11.201
It's been a couple of hours.

24:11.225 --> 24:12.431
How long must he bear it?

24:12.455 --> 24:13.750
It depends on him.

24:14.350 --> 24:15.455
What if he can't make it?

24:16.850 --> 24:18.376
He'll die, then.

24:18.400 --> 24:19.400
Ah?

24:22.725 --> 24:23.725
Senior,

24:24.900 --> 24:26.325
if His Highness dies,

24:26.625 --> 24:27.631
guards like us

24:27.655 --> 24:28.815
will be dead, too.

24:29.700 --> 24:31.950
Please save his life.

24:34.950 --> 24:35.975
I can't.

24:41.500 --> 24:43.340
I don't think
His Highness can bear it anymore.

24:44.275 --> 24:45.791
He has been living a comfortable life.

24:45.815 --> 24:47.400
How can he bear such torture?

24:47.700 --> 24:48.700
In this case,

24:50.350 --> 24:51.870
we'd better consider it for ourselves.

24:52.200 --> 24:53.625
What's your point?

24:56.475 --> 24:58.025
I worked for North Liang,

24:58.575 --> 24:59.855
because I wanted a shelter

24:59.975 --> 25:01.031
and I wanted to ask His Lordship

25:01.055 --> 25:02.695
for White Emperor
Esoterica of Simplicity.

25:03.225 --> 25:04.855
However,

25:05.650 --> 25:07.455
I never want to die.

25:07.825 --> 25:09.050
You're leaving?

25:11.900 --> 25:13.300
After His Highness dies,

25:13.825 --> 25:15.825
who knows
how His Lordship will punish us?

25:18.150 --> 25:19.175
If I leave now,

25:20.075 --> 25:21.895
I may survive.

25:23.025 --> 25:24.700
A deserter will be beheaded.

25:29.075 --> 25:30.215
I'm a guard,

25:31.095 --> 25:32.575
not a soldier.

25:33.975 --> 25:35.215
General Ning,

25:36.875 --> 25:38.015
let her go.

25:41.025 --> 25:42.650
Xu Fengnian can't make it.

25:43.525 --> 25:44.655
I kindly advise you

25:45.250 --> 25:46.690
to think about the consequence, too.

26:00.400 --> 26:02.075
This is awkward.

26:03.700 --> 26:05.695
If only you could leave a bit later!

26:13.625 --> 26:15.050
Please punish me, Your Highness.

26:16.550 --> 26:17.925
I thought you would run away.

26:18.500 --> 26:19.815
Now that you're alive,

26:20.400 --> 26:21.535
I'll get more benefits

26:21.625 --> 26:22.895
if I stay.

26:25.150 --> 26:26.150
You may rise.

26:27.325 --> 26:28.325
Your Highness,

26:28.600 --> 26:29.875
we can't keep a girl like her.

26:30.800 --> 26:33.325
I'll give you
White Emperor Esoterica of Simplicity.

26:36.600 --> 26:38.535
I pledge my life to you, Your Highness.

26:40.125 --> 26:41.855
That's not true.

26:42.950 --> 26:44.295
We both know

26:44.850 --> 26:46.100
that you don't want to die.

26:46.800 --> 26:47.855
But it doesn't matter.

26:48.450 --> 26:49.471
Not all my subordinates

26:49.495 --> 26:51.295
have to die for me.

26:52.250 --> 26:53.375
North Liang is big.

26:53.875 --> 26:55.600
There's space for a mere girl.

26:56.300 --> 26:58.175
You're as generous as Xu Xiao.

26:59.225 --> 27:00.895
North Liang will prosper.

27:04.475 --> 27:06.550
Is there a stream or pool nearby?

27:07.025 --> 27:08.615
There's blood on my clothes.

27:48.225 --> 27:50.625
It's the invulnerable Kylin Armor?

27:50.975 --> 27:52.375
Invulnerable?

27:52.625 --> 27:53.951
Miss Hehe cut it

27:53.975 --> 27:55.425
with only one stroke.

27:55.625 --> 27:57.226
She has strange martial arts.

27:57.250 --> 27:58.231
Without the Armor,

27:58.255 --> 27:59.450
you would have been dead.

27:59.575 --> 28:01.455
Unfortunately, there isn't
a second Kylin Armor.

28:02.075 --> 28:03.700
You no longer need it, anyway.

28:04.300 --> 28:05.700
What level is your Dahuangting now?

28:06.650 --> 28:08.425
According to the rule of Wudang,

28:08.500 --> 28:09.500
it's the fourth level.

28:09.875 --> 28:11.726
How lucky you are!

28:11.750 --> 28:14.111
Even Wang Chonglou has
sixth-level Dahuangting only.

28:14.135 --> 28:15.326
Are you saying

28:15.350 --> 28:16.871
I have to be grateful to Miss Hehe?

28:16.895 --> 28:19.135
Letting her kill you
will be the best token of gratitude.

28:19.900 --> 28:20.551
Senior.

28:20.575 --> 28:21.227
Mm?

28:21.251 --> 28:22.950
Am I a master now?

28:23.225 --> 28:24.400
Not at all.

28:24.525 --> 28:26.475
But you have great tenacity.

28:27.200 --> 28:28.900
Do you mind

28:29.050 --> 28:30.750
teaching me some super swordplay?

28:31.300 --> 28:33.031
You use blades.
Why do you want to learn swordplay?

28:33.055 --> 28:34.335
I can do both.

28:34.450 --> 28:35.850
It's greedy of you.

29:01.575 --> 29:03.255
This is the swordplay
of Snakes in Sleeves.

29:03.475 --> 29:05.366
If you can't master it
before arriving in Wudi City,

29:05.390 --> 29:06.850
you're not destined to have it.

29:09.200 --> 29:11.601
You're teaching me Snakes in Sleeves?

29:11.625 --> 29:12.926
Whatever.

29:12.950 --> 29:14.650
You may not master it.

29:17.450 --> 29:18.615
What are you looking at?

29:20.175 --> 29:22.551
Didn't Lord of Jing'an
return your sword to you?

29:22.575 --> 29:24.175
Why are you still
using the wooden sword?

29:24.225 --> 29:25.335
I threw it away.

29:25.600 --> 29:26.375
You did?

29:26.500 --> 29:27.432
Why?

29:27.456 --> 29:29.791
Why do I need a broken sword?

29:29.815 --> 29:30.926
But that's a famous sword.

29:30.950 --> 29:31.950
Don't you mind?

29:32.000 --> 29:33.151
Powerful as I am,

29:33.175 --> 29:34.631
even I use a blunt sword
from a blacksmith's shop,

29:34.655 --> 29:35.735
I'll still be God of Sword.

29:36.150 --> 29:37.600
How powerful are you?

29:39.050 --> 29:40.725
Without me,

29:40.925 --> 29:43.055
swordsmanship would be in the dark!

29:52.135 --> 29:54.075
You're quite boasting.

29:54.575 --> 29:55.935
Few people can do that.

29:56.600 --> 29:57.775
I'm modest enough.

30:00.625 --> 30:01.675
We've had enough rest.

30:02.100 --> 30:03.100
Time to leave.

30:03.225 --> 30:04.225
Mm.

30:04.675 --> 30:06.075
By the way, senior,

30:06.425 --> 30:07.850
have you thought

30:08.200 --> 30:09.475
about getting married?

30:10.800 --> 30:12.935
What do you think of Pei Nanwei?

30:14.200 --> 30:16.350
Are you out of your mind?

30:17.575 --> 30:18.575
Seriously,

30:19.000 --> 30:20.300
Pei Nanwei

30:20.750 --> 30:22.935
is a hot potato.

30:23.000 --> 30:25.295
Even Lord of Jing'an thinks she's fishy.

30:25.550 --> 30:27.055
If we travel with her,

30:27.200 --> 30:29.175
there'll be a lot of trouble.

30:29.575 --> 30:31.295
But we can't send her back to Xiangfan.

30:31.625 --> 30:33.255
If you can marry her,

30:33.375 --> 30:34.601
you'll keep her under control.

30:34.625 --> 30:35.625
Get lost!

30:40.425 --> 30:41.176
Grandpa Wei.

30:41.200 --> 30:41.991
Your Highness.

30:42.015 --> 30:43.015
Senior.

30:43.075 --> 30:44.231
Qingzhou Cavalry

30:44.255 --> 30:45.351
has caught up.

30:45.375 --> 30:46.535
It doesn't make sense.

30:47.100 --> 30:48.351
If Lord of Jing'an wanted to kill me,

30:48.375 --> 30:49.695
he needn't have waited until now.

30:50.125 --> 30:51.125
It's...

30:51.325 --> 30:52.475
Young Master Zhao Xun.

30:52.775 --> 30:54.015
He came for Consort of Jing'an.

30:55.550 --> 30:56.550
See?

30:57.275 --> 30:58.455
Here comes the trouble.

31:05.800 --> 31:07.015
Give her to me

31:07.325 --> 31:08.375
and I'll let you leave.

31:08.675 --> 31:09.695
Here we meet again.

31:10.375 --> 31:11.575
The wound on your face...

31:11.650 --> 31:12.775
Has it recovered?

31:13.325 --> 31:14.575
Give her to me.

31:14.675 --> 31:15.675
Who?

31:16.300 --> 31:17.711
You kidnapped Consort of Jing'an.

31:17.735 --> 31:19.150
You're quite ignoring us.

31:21.050 --> 31:22.311
How dare you come to stop me

31:22.335 --> 31:23.775
with only so few soldiers!

31:24.075 --> 31:25.315
Your father isn't aware, is he?

31:27.175 --> 31:29.295
This is the struggle
between Qingzhou and North Liang.

31:29.825 --> 31:31.375
Martial artists shouldn't interfere.

31:34.750 --> 31:35.750
You're scared?

31:37.500 --> 31:38.671
I ask for a battle assignment.

31:38.695 --> 31:39.975
I would like to capture him,

31:40.125 --> 31:41.351
for your disposal, Your Highness.

31:41.375 --> 31:42.375
How about this?

31:43.350 --> 31:44.551
Let me ask her.

31:44.575 --> 31:46.376
If she wants to go with you,

31:46.400 --> 31:47.535
I'll let her go.

31:52.325 --> 31:53.575
You heard us.

31:54.050 --> 31:55.970
Do you want to go back
to Xiangfan with Zhao Xun?

32:02.600 --> 32:03.376
See?

32:03.400 --> 32:04.335
She doesn't want to leave.

32:04.400 --> 32:05.276
How's that possible?

32:05.300 --> 32:06.601
You must have threatened her.

32:06.625 --> 32:07.935
Stop saying "her".

32:08.300 --> 32:10.050
She's your stepmother.

32:12.050 --> 32:13.300
Get ready to fight.

32:15.200 --> 32:16.415
Your Highness,

32:16.825 --> 32:18.511
I'm sorry.

32:18.535 --> 32:20.175
I'd like to accept any punishment!

32:20.425 --> 32:22.375
I'm sorry that you've suffered!

32:25.950 --> 32:26.950
Your Highness.

32:26.975 --> 32:27.975
Your Highness.

32:28.025 --> 32:28.951
I'm late.

32:28.975 --> 32:29.676
Your Highness.

32:29.700 --> 32:30.312
Your Highness,

32:30.336 --> 32:31.855
let me check on you.

32:32.150 --> 32:33.150
Have you been hurt?

32:33.750 --> 32:34.855
Have you barked your skin?

32:39.050 --> 32:41.135
The monster Chu Lushan has come.

32:42.350 --> 32:43.675
Li Chungang is around, too.

32:45.125 --> 32:47.015
How can I kill my brother-in-law?

32:48.325 --> 32:49.850
Isn't it too hard?

32:50.525 --> 32:52.251
Fengzi Battalion neglected their duty

32:52.275 --> 32:54.226
and made you hurt.

32:54.250 --> 32:55.112
That's enough.

32:55.136 --> 32:56.475
Stand up. Stand up.

32:57.275 --> 32:58.550
Your Highness,

33:04.725 --> 33:05.750
who's he?

33:06.975 --> 33:08.111
Son of Lord of Jing'an.

33:08.135 --> 33:09.175
He came to fight me.

33:09.625 --> 33:11.415
Good, then.

33:13.775 --> 33:14.775
Chu Lushan,

33:15.350 --> 33:17.071
you're a general of sub-third rank.

33:17.095 --> 33:18.950
How dare you leave North Liang
with your army?

33:19.500 --> 33:21.125
He's so nagging.

33:21.350 --> 33:22.400
Shall I kill him?

33:23.025 --> 33:25.071
He's the son of Lord of Jing'an.

33:25.095 --> 33:26.535
We don't have a reason to kill him.

33:26.800 --> 33:28.375
It's not a problem.

33:29.050 --> 33:30.215
Let's kill them all.

33:30.475 --> 33:31.352
Then let's set a fire

33:31.376 --> 33:32.875
and burn their bodies.

33:33.625 --> 33:34.975
Do you hear him?

33:35.550 --> 33:37.275
It's not too late to leave now.

33:37.425 --> 33:38.476
When the fight starts,

33:38.500 --> 33:39.815
I can't stop him.

33:40.150 --> 33:41.150
Your Highness,

33:41.175 --> 33:42.815
Chu Lushan is famous
for his ruthlessness.

33:42.875 --> 33:44.095
If we fight directly,

33:44.150 --> 33:45.430
I'm afraid we can't defeat them.

33:51.025 --> 33:53.225
I'll take revenge
for what happened today!

33:56.775 --> 33:59.650
I dare you to point
at His Highness again!

34:04.300 --> 34:05.076
Let's go back to Xiangfan.

34:05.100 --> 34:06.100
Wait a minute.

34:07.200 --> 34:08.500
Don't push it.

34:08.700 --> 34:09.975
Give the blade back to me.

34:25.400 --> 34:26.400
Go.

34:40.825 --> 34:42.650
It's benevolent of you, Your Highness.

34:43.175 --> 34:44.511
In my opinion,

34:44.535 --> 34:45.735
we should just kill such guys.

34:46.700 --> 34:47.911
Why did you come?

34:47.935 --> 34:49.055
Godfather sent me.

34:49.425 --> 34:50.151
Xu Xiao?

34:50.175 --> 34:50.795
Yeah.

34:51.100 --> 34:52.255
Isn't he in the capital?

34:52.525 --> 34:54.911
He asked me to lead my cavalry

34:54.935 --> 34:56.251
to Qingzhou for you when I received

34:56.275 --> 34:57.671
the sword tassel sent by a hawk.

34:57.695 --> 34:58.602
What hawk?

34:58.626 --> 34:59.725
I don't know.

34:59.875 --> 35:01.751
I just saw the hawk that day

35:01.775 --> 35:02.775
and then I set out.

35:03.225 --> 35:04.775
Luckily, I arrived in time

35:04.875 --> 35:05.976
and didn't let them hurt you.

35:06.000 --> 35:07.000
Wait.

35:07.825 --> 35:09.350
Why did Xu Xiao send you to Qingzhou?

35:09.800 --> 35:10.712
He didn't tell me the reason.

35:10.736 --> 35:12.825
He simply asked me
to take orders from you.

35:14.250 --> 35:15.335
Shall I

35:15.675 --> 35:17.376
go to Wudi City with you?

35:17.400 --> 35:18.400
Ridiculous.

35:18.800 --> 35:20.875
What do you think I should do, then?

35:24.050 --> 35:25.050
Go back to North Liang.

35:25.200 --> 35:26.200
Ah?

35:26.450 --> 35:27.911
I came all the way here.

35:27.935 --> 35:29.175
But you want me to return?

35:32.375 --> 35:33.375
How about this?

35:33.875 --> 35:34.876
Let them go back

35:34.900 --> 35:36.076
and let me stay.

35:36.100 --> 35:37.511
You're a general of sub-third rank.

35:37.535 --> 35:38.991
Qingzhou is the farthest you can reach.

35:39.015 --> 35:40.151
If you keep following me,
what will the royal family think?

35:40.175 --> 35:41.591
I'll quit my job, then.

35:41.615 --> 35:42.275
Nonsense.

35:42.600 --> 35:43.700
Just go away.

35:44.150 --> 35:45.451
Your Highness.

35:45.475 --> 35:46.475
Shut up.

35:50.775 --> 35:52.800
I came all the way...

36:00.725 --> 36:01.431
Wait.

36:01.455 --> 36:02.455
Mm?

36:04.075 --> 36:05.500
Speaking of it,

36:06.325 --> 36:08.625
I've got a mission for you.

36:12.175 --> 36:14.325
This is Consort of Jing'an?

36:15.175 --> 36:16.495
She's indeed beautiful.

36:17.300 --> 36:18.431
Escort the two ladies

36:18.455 --> 36:19.575
back to North Liang.

36:20.700 --> 36:22.176
If you want to entrust me to Chu Lushan,

36:22.200 --> 36:23.425
I would rather die.

36:23.775 --> 36:25.951
Look what a bad reputation you have.

36:25.975 --> 36:26.975
Don't worry, Your Grace.

36:27.400 --> 36:29.501
I've done all kinds of evil things.

36:29.525 --> 36:30.615
But there's an exception.

36:30.800 --> 36:32.111
I never touch anyone

36:32.135 --> 36:33.375
entrusted by His Highness.

36:33.725 --> 36:35.101
Send Qingniao back to my mansion

36:35.125 --> 36:36.295
for a good recuperation.

36:36.625 --> 36:38.100
As for Consort of Jing'an...

36:38.500 --> 36:40.111
She has a special status

36:40.135 --> 36:41.455
and can't be kept in my mansion.

36:42.625 --> 36:44.526
Shall I find a house

36:44.550 --> 36:46.200
and hide her in Yanzhi County?

36:48.300 --> 36:49.535
Sounds feasible.

36:49.800 --> 36:50.920
But you must keep it secret.

36:50.975 --> 36:52.151
I understand.

36:52.175 --> 36:54.111
I'll keep her there
without telling anyone.

36:54.135 --> 36:56.551
When you're back,
you can have a good time with her.

36:56.575 --> 36:58.415
What are you talking about?

36:58.675 --> 37:00.700
She's my aunt, speaking of seniority.

37:01.055 --> 37:03.476
That's why I'll keep it secret.

37:03.500 --> 37:04.675
Don't talk nonsense.

37:04.775 --> 37:06.225
Just keep an eye on her.

37:06.600 --> 37:07.600
Aye, Your Highness.

37:09.275 --> 37:11.326
I know you're keeping a secret.

37:11.350 --> 37:12.925
After I'm back in North Liang,

37:13.550 --> 37:14.695
I'll ask you.

37:16.050 --> 37:17.050
Your Highness.

37:17.750 --> 37:18.750
You're awake?

37:20.575 --> 37:21.750
I'm not going back.

37:22.950 --> 37:24.325
But you're wounded.

37:25.200 --> 37:27.095
I want to travel with you.

37:38.500 --> 37:40.175
Chu Lushan will not go with Xu Fengnian.

37:43.800 --> 37:44.895
Master?

37:50.200 --> 37:51.960
Are you going
to kill Xu Fengnian personally?

37:53.950 --> 37:55.295
I can't show myself.

37:56.225 --> 37:57.415
But if you don't go,

37:57.750 --> 38:00.295
who else can kill Xu Fengnian
when Li Chungang is around?

38:01.450 --> 38:03.095
Even if I tried,

38:03.450 --> 38:05.535
I might not defeat Li Chungang, either.

38:05.850 --> 38:06.850
Ah?

38:10.100 --> 38:11.615
What do we do, then?

38:12.525 --> 38:14.815
Among five Fujiang Armors,

38:15.350 --> 38:16.735
only the Gold Armor is available.

38:20.150 --> 38:21.625
Go to Mount Longhu.

38:23.550 --> 38:24.575
Mount Longhu?

38:25.000 --> 38:26.455
For Four Longhu Arch-Taoists?

38:27.525 --> 38:29.015
Go find the Fisherman

38:29.325 --> 38:31.550
by the Bottomless Pool
deep behind the mountain.

38:32.150 --> 38:33.825
If we want to fight Li Chungang,

38:34.325 --> 38:36.175
we have to depend on the Fisherman.

38:37.950 --> 38:40.135
Is the Fisherman

38:41.900 --> 38:43.335
a great master in isolation?

38:46.000 --> 38:47.300
But without a reason,

38:47.875 --> 38:48.832
why would he

38:48.856 --> 38:50.535
help me to kill Xu Fengnian?

38:52.475 --> 38:54.055
He's Zhao Huangchao.

38:56.375 --> 38:59.025
He's also from the royal family.

39:01.895 --> 39:02.935
Royal family?

39:05.475 --> 39:08.655
The Xu Family is the biggest obstacle
of the royal family.

39:09.025 --> 39:10.735
If you convince him with this reason,

39:11.300 --> 39:13.095
he will help you, I guess.

39:19.400 --> 39:20.895
After Xu Fengnian is killed,

39:22.075 --> 39:24.895
I have to aggravate
the situation personally

39:25.800 --> 39:28.255
so that Xu Xiao will rebel
and leave the capital.

39:28.350 --> 39:29.925
When the world is in chaos,

39:30.750 --> 39:34.075
you'll have a chance
to take over the throne.

39:38.650 --> 39:40.175
Thank you, Master,

39:41.325 --> 39:42.615
for racking your brains.

39:45.600 --> 39:46.875
No plan can be activated

39:47.375 --> 39:50.895
until Xu Fengnian is killed.

39:53.550 --> 39:54.615
I understand.

39:55.250 --> 39:56.575
My brother-in-law

39:58.150 --> 39:59.415
has to be killed.

40:02.950 --> 40:04.700
Please take good care of yourself.

40:05.550 --> 40:06.550
On your way,

40:07.050 --> 40:08.831
if anyone dares to be rude to you,

40:08.855 --> 40:09.855
keep that in mind.

40:10.250 --> 40:12.275
Later, I'll kill them all.

40:13.225 --> 40:14.650
How dare you stay that!

40:14.900 --> 40:16.675
You're no longer scared
of military laws?

40:16.925 --> 40:18.525
You're more important
than military laws.

40:20.325 --> 40:22.250
Go take care of another thing.

40:23.150 --> 40:25.390
Wang Linquan and his family
have returned to North Liang.

40:26.250 --> 40:27.415
Look after them for me.

40:27.600 --> 40:28.800
Don't let them feel aggrieved.

40:28.975 --> 40:30.225
Don't worry, Your Highness.

40:36.275 --> 40:38.295
Lyu Qiantang died in the reeds.

40:38.950 --> 40:40.215
Here are his cremains.

40:41.875 --> 40:43.350
Take them back to North Liang, too.

40:44.225 --> 40:46.450
Find out
where the Lin Family settled down.

40:48.900 --> 40:50.525
Before his death, he said

40:50.875 --> 40:53.335
that he wanted his cremains
to be cast into the river.

40:55.000 --> 40:57.135
But I believe he wants to go home.

40:58.100 --> 40:59.455
Take him back home.

41:01.000 --> 41:02.400
Count on me.

41:13.225 --> 41:14.475
Take care, Your Highness!

41:28.850 --> 41:30.075
How far has Yu Youwei gone?

41:30.325 --> 41:31.450
Not far ahead of us.

41:31.875 --> 41:33.576
Let's go and meet her

41:33.600 --> 41:34.800
before we keep going east.

41:35.050 --> 41:36.050
Yes.

41:41.175 --> 41:42.215
Look at you.

41:48.125 --> 41:49.575
I was just dizzy.

41:49.825 --> 41:51.935
I feel much better after some sleep.

42:11.200 --> 42:12.200
Your Highness,

42:12.450 --> 42:13.751
I can still drive the carriage.

42:13.775 --> 42:14.752
Don't talk nonsense.

42:14.776 --> 42:15.900
Sit here for recuperation.

42:19.335 --> 42:20.425
Where are we going?

42:22.425 --> 42:23.275
Jiangnan.
[♪Jiangnan: south of the Yangtze River]

42:23.425 --> 42:24.785
I'm going to see my eldest sister.

42:26.025 --> 42:28.225
Chu Lushan was sent by Xu Xiao, right?

42:29.450 --> 42:30.450
Yes.

42:31.050 --> 42:32.895
He came right in time.

42:35.150 --> 42:37.431
I thought I didn't choose the way
Xu Xiao arranged for me.

42:37.625 --> 42:38.950
But in the end,

42:39.200 --> 42:40.351
I've been doing everything

42:40.375 --> 42:41.675
in the way he expected.

42:42.325 --> 42:43.651
He's your father, after all.

42:43.675 --> 42:45.501
No one else in this world
knows more about you than him.

42:45.525 --> 42:47.100
He has arranged the future for you.

42:47.150 --> 42:48.550
You can't get away.

42:50.300 --> 42:51.300
Here we go.

43:29.855 --> 43:32.575
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.350 --> 43:37.150
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.075 --> 43:41.995
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.075 --> 43:46.875
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.175 --> 43:51.075
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.775 --> 43:55.595
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.600 --> 44:00.355
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.375 --> 44:05.300
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.800 --> 44:08.531
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.555 --> 44:09.795
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.575 --> 44:14.435
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.250 --> 44:17.976
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:18.000 --> 44:19.435
♪ The vanity ♪

44:19.925 --> 44:23.800
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.225 --> 44:25.576
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.600 --> 44:28.435
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.850 --> 44:31.331
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.355 --> 44:33.755
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.050 --> 44:36.076
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.100 --> 44:38.276
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.300 --> 44:42.515
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.875 --> 44:44.011
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.035 --> 44:47.075
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.250 --> 44:49.211
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.235 --> 44:51.955
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.515 --> 44:54.331
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.355 --> 44:56.851
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.875 --> 45:01.175
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
